      "description": "Find golfers by name to get their GHIN number and current index. Give a last name, a first name, or both; add a 2-letter US state code (e.g. VA) to narrow it. Returns up to 25 active US golfers. Several people often share a name: show the matches (name, club, state) and let the user pick before saving anyone to the roster.",
